  promptText: {fileID: 648661491}
  dialogueManager: {fileID: 373608717}
  dialogue:
    sentences:
    - Everyone, listen up!
    - ' My name is Commander Arden Shaw, your direct line of command...'
    - Many of you here have been displaced by infected or raiders...
    - Today, we take it all back, starting with the west coast...
    - As many of you may know, Seattle is our end game...
    - It is currently being controlled by the W.L.F, but not if we can help it...
    - That is the end goal ladies and gentlemen, but first, we have to make it there...
    - So, I want your ideas, where should we liberate first?
